{
  "reason": "The reference answer states unsupported law outside the indexed sources by discussing the subsequent enactment and effective date of Ley 12/2023. The question only asked about the legal situation on 1 March 2022, which is fully and accurately resolved by Article 20 paragraph 1 of the Ley de Arrendamientos Urbanos as provided.",
  "verdict": "dispute",
  "issues": ["unsupported_claim"],
  "proposed_fix": "Not for a landlord who is a natural person. On 1 March 2022, the final paragraph of Article 20, paragraph 1 of the Ley de Arrendamientos Urbanos provided that real estate management and contract formalisation expenses were to be borne by the landlord only when the landlord was a legal person, without establishing that rule for individual landlords."
}
